          "settings": {
            "title": "What's included?",
            "content": "<p>(3) Cold-pressed juices and (3) plant-based smoothies each cleanse day.<br/>3 days / 18 bottles  5 days / 30 bottles  7 days / 42 bottles  10 days / 60 bottles<br/>(1) Cleanse Guide including:<br/>• How to prepare for your cleanse. • What to do during your cleanse. • How to maintain your results and continue supporting your weight management goals after your cleanse is finished. • A list of cleanse-approved foods, including high-protein plants. • A cleanse-approved Hearty Vegetable Soup recipe.<br/>Subscribe & Save customers will get everything above, PLUS:<br/>•10% off every order. • Free shipping on every order. • A monthly virtual group consultation with our Chief Nutrition Officer to ask her all of your health, wellness, and weight management questions.  • Access to a private Facebook Group to get answers to your questions in between the monthly calls.<br/><br/></p>",
